  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEMCAR Budget and Revenue Systems Enhancement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEMCAR&apos;s overall objective is to improve economic managementcomma regional integration and competitiveness in up to 12 Caribbean countries through more efficientcomma effective and accountable public institutionscomma policiescomma processes and ICT systems. This is being achieved through the provision of policy advicecomma technical assistance and selected ICT investments. The Project Development Objective (PDO) of the proposed operation is to strengthen and modernize selected ICT systems in Taxcomma Customscomma and Public Financial Management used by targeted institutions in Antigua and Barbudacomma Belizecomma Dominicacomma Grenadacomma St. Kitts and Neviscomma St. Luciacomma and St. Vincent and the Grenadines. The proposed operation is expected to contribute to SEMCAR&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s key results through: (i) improved revenue collection due to more efficient processing and clearance procedurescomma (ii) enhanced investment climate and economic development due to efficiency gainscomma and (iii) greater access to crucial information that will allow for the formulation of more sound macro-economic and fiscal policies. Thereforecomma the ICT investments aimed for under the project will enable the Recipients to institutionalize and operationalizekey policies and processes developed under SEMCARcomma and thereby contribute to improved economic management in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
